  "description": "A scene where a Black woman is depicted holding an American flag, with overlaid text that reads: \"i say woman of color because i want to be inclusive of all but white women.\" The scene is designed to convey a hateful and exclusionary message by juxtaposing the woman's identity with a racist and divisive statement. The visual material (the woman) and the textual material (the overlaid text) are directly related in this scene, with the text serving as the primary message and the woman's image being used to visually support the exclusionary intent.",
